# ttfautohint control instructions for this font only (see
# scripts/autohint_fonts.py --ctrl-dir). Windows rendering only; macOS ignores
# hinting.
#
# i, j: the dot-to-stem gap is about 1px at 13-14px in the bold weights, so the
# hinted dot merges into the stem (i reads as l). Lift the dot (points 0-3, the
# first contour in both glyphs) one pixel at those sizes. ij is built from i and
# j, so it follows. Re-check the point numbers and sizes if i or j changes.
i touch 0-3 yshift 1 @ 13, 14
j touch 0-3 yshift 1 @ 13, 14
